{"id":"surpreendido","lemma":"surpreendido","pos":"adj","rank":1997,"glosses":["surprised","astonished, amazed","startled, perplexed"],"ipa":"/suɾ.pɾi.ẽˈdi.du/","forms":{"feminine":"surpreendida","masculinePlural":"surpreendidos","femininePlural":"surpreendidas"},"examples":[{"text":"Eles foram surpreendidos.","en":"They were surprised.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/844057","words":[{"g":"they"},null,null]},{"text":"Estava um pouco surpreendida.","en":"I was a little surprised.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,3,"slightly"]]},{"text":"Fui surpreendido.","en":"I was taken aback.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/841992","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},null]},{"text":"Nós fomos surpreendidos pelo comportamento do Tom.","en":"We were surprised by Tom's behavior.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},null,{"g":"by / for the","l":"pelar"},{"g":"behaviour"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"tone"}]},{"text":"O Tom e eu ficamos surpreendidos com o que vimos.","en":"Tom and I were surprised by what we saw.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"tone"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"ficar"},null,{"g":"with"},null,null,{"g":"to come","l":"vir"}],"phrases":[[7,9,"what"]]}]}